OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FIt will be
OL,6,Fdry through the evening with good
OL,7,Fclear spells and winds falling light.
OL,8,FStaying dry with lengthy clear spells
OL,9,Fand light winds overnight.
OL,10,
OL,11,CThursday:FDry and bright morning but
OL,12,Fsunshine turning hazy as high cloud
OL,13,Fspills east through the day. Southerly
OL,14,Fwinds strengthen through the day with
OL,15,Frain in the afternoon and evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
